# --- Editor access ---------------------------------------------------------
# Browsing the admin is public and read-only. Only the people listed here can
# sign in, and signing in is what grants the right to add, edit or delete.
#
# One entry per editor as email:salt:hash, comma separated. Generate an entry
# with:  npm run editor -- someone@example.com
# Passwords are scrypt-hashed; the plaintext is never stored anywhere.
# Deleting an entry revokes that person on their very next request.
EDITORS=""

# Session signing key. Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
AUTH_SECRET=""
